# FPGA-Based Temperature Sensor

An FPGA-based temperature monitoring system using the **Nexys Artix-7 FPGA board** and **ADT7420 digital temperature sensor**.

### Features
- I²C communication between FPGA and ADT7420.
- Verilog-based I²C master controller.
- Reads and processes digital temperature data.
- Displays real-time temperature readings.

### Hardware
- Nexys Artix-7 FPGA Board
- ADT7420 Temperature Sensor

### Tools
- Verilog HDL
- Xilinx Vivado
- I²C Protocol
